    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d73-a1">

                <pb facs="0133" n="83" sameAs="frus:frus1894/pg83"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Inclosure 1 in No. 275.]</seg></opener>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Thompson to Mr. Nascimento.</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Legation of the United States</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Petropolis</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1894-07-17"><hi rendition="#italic">July 17,
                        1894</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>I have the honor to inclose to your excellency the certificate of appointment of
                    Reuben Cleary, an American citizen, as deputy consul-general of the United
                    States at Rio de Janeiro, and to request that an exequatur be issued recognizing
                    Mr. Cleary in his official capacity.</p>
                <p>I reiterate, etc.,</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Thomas L.
                    Thompson.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
